===Noun===
{{en-noun|butterfly fish|es}}

# Any fish of the family [[Chaetodontidae]].
# {{taxlink|Pantodon buchholzi|species|noshow=1|ver=161102}}, a small brown fish of western African streams, often found in aquariums.
# The {{vern|butterfly cod}} ({{taxlink|Pterois volitans|species|noshow=1|ver=161102}}).
# The {{vern|ocellated blenny}} ({{taxlink|Opisthocentrus ocellatus|species|noshow=1|ver=161102}}).
# The [[flying gurnard]] ({{taxlink|Dactyloptena orientalis|species|noshow=1|ver=161102}}).
# {{taxlink|Exocoetus volitans|species|noshow=1|ver=1611021}}, a [[flying fish]] of the Atlantic.
# A [[chiton]], a [[mollusc]] of the class [[Polyplacophora]].
# Any of several brightly colored fishes

